    },
    "estimand": "PRIMARY: pooled paired difference in macro out-of-fold AUROC, unexposed minus exposed, across three matched seeds, bootstrapped over studies using the SAME resample indices for both arms and resampling the per-study difference. This measures how much of the published 0.7105 is exposure inflation. The unexposed arm alone is the project's first gold-probe number that is an estimate of generalisation rather than a development statistic -- at study level, not patient level, since patient identity is unverifiable.",
